{"author":{"id":"b409816c5cd5ab140d1d52eb33aace35de44952bb794b19806fd57f6ecb1ace9"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1792793740,"nonce":"nBdyhoIEuZT90qNJN60HpK8nXAw=","title":"TypeScript: inline object type annotations and honest library type gaps","message":"Inline object type literals (`function f(p: { x: number })`, return and variable annotations, assertions) share the record layouts and views that type aliases get: a pre-pass registers every literal whose fields are known, before and after the alias fixpoint, and ty() looks them up by source offset. Literals needing generic parameters or unsupported fields stay unregistered and report Unsupported where used. String-literal element access (`x[\"o\"]`, `` x[`o`] ``) reads and writes the same property as `x.o`.\n\nTwo false Type errors are now explicit gaps: type names the standard and DOM libraries declare (Object, String, Number, Boolean, Function, Date, RegExp, ArrayBuffer, HTML*/SVG* and others) report \"library type X\" Unsupported instead of \"unknown type\", and string-key access on arrays and primitives reports the existing primitive-properties gap instead of \"value is not an array\". Local declarations still shadow library names; undeclared names keep the Type error.\n\nOfficial corpus: PASS 960 -\u003e 947, FAIL 103 -\u003e 97, UNSUPPORTED 2341 -\u003e 2360, SKIP 3421; no crash, timeout or transition to FAIL. New passes: assignmentToParenthesizedIdentifiers (2322 at the same assignment), parserObjectType1 and parserObjectType2 (accepted).\n\nFalse passes now Unsupported (each passed only on a false error; the reference errors elsewhere or not on that name):\n- controlFlow/controlFlowForInStatement (`RegExp`)\n- es2017/assignSharedArrayBufferToArrayBuffer#1 (`ArrayBuffer`)\n- es6/destructuring/destructuringParameterDeclaration3ES5 and ES6 (`String`)\n- es6/templates/taggedTemplateUntypedTagCall01 (`Function`)\n- es7/exponentiationOperator/exponentiationOperatorWithNullValueAndInvalidOperands, ...WithUndefinedValueAndInvalidOperands (`Object`)\n- expressions/binaryOperators/additionOperator/additionOperatorWithNullValueAndInvalidOperator, ...WithUndefinedValueAndInvalidOperands (`Object`)\n- expressions/binaryOperators/arithmeticOperator/arithmeticOperatorWithNullValueAndInvalidOperands, ...WithUndefinedValueAndInvalidOperands (`Object`)\n- parser/ecmascript5/parserArgumentList1 (`HTMLElement`)\n- types/primitives/boolean/assignFromBooleanInterface (`Boolean`), number/assignFromNumberInterface (`Number`), string/assignFromStringInterface (`String`)\n- types/primitives/string/stringPropertyAccessWithError (`x['charAt']`, was \"value is not an array\")\n\nFalse rejections of accepted files now Unsupported: controlFlowForOfStatement (`RegExp`), controlFlowInstanceOfGuardPrimitives (`Date`), scopeResolutionIdentifiers (`Date`), templateStringInIndexExpression and ...ES6 (string index on a template), salsa/typeFromPropertyAssignment38 (`F[\"prop\"]` on a function).\n\nParent: 5f1038edb654e4276e10f1d0870b261f397479f2f88710b5f1df265347474022.","files":null}]}